	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 4th level, the sentinel gains the ability to reconstruct their undead companion. During a short rest after the undead companion has died, the sentinel can restore it to 1 HP so long as they are able to recover at least one pound of the undead’s remains. If they choose, they may also expend their own hit dice to provide healing to their undead companion.</p>",
